        card("3. A clause can be converted to a phrase using ka-an/han/nan", "The noun clause on the left becomes the phrase on the right.", examples=passage(_CL)),
        card("The markers of ka-an/han/nan nouns", "Ka-an/han/nan noun formations, being abstract words, are preceded by the markers ang (Set 1, as the focus of the sentence), ng (Set 2, as a non-focus) and sa (Set 3, as the object of a preposition). In the examples above, dahil sa is Set 3 (preposition) and ang is Set 1 (focus of the sentence)."),
