_SA = [("Sumulat sa akin si Ms. Anita Paway, pangulo ng Samahang Kapatiran ng Doña Petra ng Concepcion Uno, Marikina City.", "Ms. Anita Paway wrote to me, president of the Samahang Kapatiran ng Doña Petra of Concepcion Uno, Marikina City."), ("Ito ay kaugnay ng matagal nang reklamo ng kanilang organisasyon tungkol sa namumuong bundok ng basura dahil sa illegal dumping operation ng pamahalaang lungsod sa naturang lugar.", "This is related to their organization’s long-standing complaint about a growing mountain of garbage because of the city government’s illegal dumping operation in that area."), ("Umaabot na raw sa taas na sampung metro ang tambak ng basurang ito.", "This pile of garbage is said to already reach ten meters in height."), ("Sa patuloy at walang puknat na pagtatapon, hindi malayong maging bagong Smokey Mountain ang lugar na iyan.", "With continuous and unending dumping, it is not far-fetched that the place will become a new Smokey Mountain."), ("Bukod sa pangit tingnan, nanganganib pa ang kalusugan ng tao hindi lamang sa Marikina kundi sa ibang karatig na lugar dahil ito ay malapit sa baybayin ng ilog.", "Besides being ugly to look at, people’s health is also in danger, not only in Marikina but in other neighboring places, because it is near the riverbank.")]
